repository-code: https://github.com/stajichlab/AAFTF
abstract: >-
  AAFTF automates draft genome assembly from Illumina short reads (optionally with long reads), with read trimming and contaminant
  filtering, assembly, vector and contaminant screening of contigs, duplicate removal, contig sorting and renaming, and summary
  statistics including telomere detection. Each step is a subcommand that can be run on its own, or all together with AAFTF
  pipeline_short (Illumina), pipeline_long (ONT/PacBio) or pipeline_hybrid.
